+
+**Mikeal Rogers:** Alright. Do we have anything else to say about hashing algorithms? This is a pretty deep topic to start a Javascript show with...
+
+**Alex Sexton:** \[\\00:11:59.24\\\] Yeah, interesting choice.
+
